<LegalLayout
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for gokhan.vc, the website of Gökhan Ventures."
  lastUpdated="22 June 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Gökhan Ventures</strong> (“we”, “us”) handles information
    in connection with the website at <strong>gokhan.vc</strong> (the “Services”). We collect as little
    as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not ask for or collect personal information through gokhan.vc. The site serves static
    content only. Our infrastructure provider (Cloudflare) processes standard technical request data
    (such as IP address and browser metadata) to deliver and secure the site. If you choose to email
    us at <strong>contact@gokhan.vc</strong>, we receive the contents of your message and your email
    address solely to respond.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>
    We use the limited information above only to operate, maintain, and secure the Services. Our
    <strong>lawful basis</strong> is our legitimate interest in operating, securing, and delivering the
    Services (GDPR Art 6(1)(f)). We do <strong>not</strong> sell or share personal information, and we
    do not use it for advertising, targeted advertising, or profiling (including under the CCPA/CPRA).
  </p>

  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    We rely on third-party infrastructure to run the Services: <strong>Cloudflare</strong> (hosting, security,
    delivery). The site also links out to external platforms (such as X, GitHub, LinkedIn, Farcaster,
    Bluesky, Substack, Telegram, and Discord); if you follow those links, the destination platform processes
    your data under its own policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
  <p>
    gokhan.vc does not use advertising or analytics tracking cookies. Cloudflare may set strictly
    necessary cookies for security and to operate the site. See our
    <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain technical/security logs only as long as needed for security and operation. Any email
    you send us is retained only as long as needed to handle your enquiry.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices &amp; rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the GDPR and UK GDPR you have the right to <strong
      >access, rectify, erase, restrict, and port</strong
    > your personal data, to <strong>object</strong> to processing, and to <strong
      >lodge a complaint with your data-protection supervisory authority</strong
    > (GDPR Art 77). To exercise any of these, contact <a href="mailto:contact@gokhan.vc"
      >contact@gokhan.vc</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The Services are not directed to children under 16 (or the applicable digital-consent age in
    your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect data from children.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The “last updated” date above reflects the latest
    version. Continued use of the Services after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated
    policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:contact@gokhan.vc">contact@gokhan.vc</a>. See also
    our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
